    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3l0129-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-1a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">From "Xiào Lín": A man from Wú (Wú rén) went to the capital.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-1a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">His host set out food, among which was *làosū* (a type of cheese).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-1a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">He did not know what this thing was,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-1a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">but forced himself to eat it.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-1a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">Upon returning home, he vomited and consequently became gravely ill.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-1a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">He said to his son:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-1a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">"To die from the same thing as those *cāng rén* (northern bumpkins)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-1a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">would be no cause for regret;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-1a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">however, you should still be cautious of it."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-1a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">Lèijù 72, Yùlǎn 858.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-2a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">A man from Tàiyuán had a fire break out in his house at night.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-2a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">He was moving his possessions out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-2a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">He wanted to take out his bronze spear,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-2a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">but mistakenly took out the ironing ??,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-2a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">and was greatly alarmed and bewildered.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-2a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">He said to his son:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-2a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">"What a strange thing! (These two characters are present in the *Lèijù* citation.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-2a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:09:38.517+09:00">The fire has not yet reached it,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-2a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">yet the spear has already been burned and lost its foot.’</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-2a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">*Shūchāo* 135, *Lèijù* 72, *Yùlǎn* 757</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-3a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">A certain man (the *Guǎngjì* cites this as a man from Wèi) suddenly fell ill at night</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-3a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">and ordered a servant to drill for fire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-3a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">The night was overcast and dark, and he could not get a fire.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-3a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">The man urged him pressingly (the *Guǎngjì* version says ‘pressed him quite urgently’).</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-3a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">The servant said angrily:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-3a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">‘For you to blame me is also completely unreasonable!</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-3a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">It is now dark as lacquer; why don't you hold a fire to light my way?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-3a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">Then I would be able to find the fire-drilling tools.’ (A version in *Lèijù* 80 and *Yùlǎn* 869 adds: ‘and then it would be easy to get.’) When Kǒng Wénjǔ heard of this, he said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-3a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">‘When one rebukes a person, it must be done with proper reasoning.’</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-3a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">*Guǎngjì* 258</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">There was a man paying his condolences at a funeral who also wanted to bring something to help out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">He asked someone, ‘What sort of things can I give?’</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">The person replied, ‘Money, cloth, grain, or silk—whatever you have!’</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">So he brought a *hú* of beans, placed it before the filial son, and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">‘I had nothing else, so I am helping you with one *hú* of fine beans.’ (The preceding fourteen characters are supplemented from the *Guǎngjì* version.)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">The filial son cried out in lament, ‘Alas!’</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">but the man thought he was being asked about the beans,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">and replied, ‘They can be made into a meal!’</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">The filial son cried out in lament again, ‘Destitute!’</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">but the man said: (The *Guǎngjì* version reads: The filial son cried, ‘Alone and destitute, alas!’ He said… [corrupt text] … The filial son cried again, ‘Alone and destitute!’ He said:)</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.11" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">‘If what you just got is already used up, I will naturally send another *hú*.’</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-4a.12" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">*Lèijù* 85, *Guǎngjì* 262</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">Shěn Héng’s younger brother was Jùn, style name Shūshān.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">He had a good reputation,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">but his nature was frugal and miserly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:11:20.395+09:00">When Zhāng Wēn was sent as an envoy to Shǔ, he parted from Jùn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">Jùn went inside for a good while,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">then came out and said to Wēn:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">"Just now I was choosing a roll of cloth,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">wanting to give it to you (Wáng Lìqì's edition has 也), but I have no coarse ones."</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">Wēn praised him for being able to so openly display his own fault. The above is also found in *Yìwén Lèijù*, chapter 85; *Tàipíng Yùlǎn*, chapter 820; and *Xù Tánzhù*, chapter 4.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">Another time, he was passing by the shore of Lake Tài,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.11" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">and had his attendant fetch some saltwater.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.12" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">Afterwards, he regretted that the attendant had taken too much, and ordered him to pour some back.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.13" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">Soon after, he felt ashamed of himself and said:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-5a.14" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">"This is just my inborn nature!" *Tàipíng Guǎngjì*, chapters 115-116.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">Zhào Bógōng (*Lèilín* writes Wēng) was a very fat man.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">On a summer day, he was lying down drunk.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">His grandson, who was several years old, climbed onto his belly to play,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">and then put some plums (one source says: eight or nine of them) into his navel.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.5" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">When he woke up, he did not notice at all.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.6" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">Several days later, he became aware of a pain.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.7" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">The plums had become completely rotten and juice was oozing out.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.8" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">He thought his navel had become a sore.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.9" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">Fearing he was going to die, he ordered his wife and children to arrange the family affairs.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.10" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">Weeping, he said to his family:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.11" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">"My intestines are rotting, and I am about to die!"</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.12" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">The next day, the plum stones came out. Upon inquiry,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.13" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">he learned that it was the plums his grandson had put inside.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-6a.14" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">*Tàipíng Yùlǎn*, chapters 371 and 966; *???? Yùjí*, chapter 14; *Lèilín Záshuō*, chapter 10.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-7a.1" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">During the time of Emperor Huán, there was someone who was resigning from his post as a clerk in a ducal office.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-7a.2" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">He asked someone to write the text for his memorial of resignation.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-7a.3" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">The person was unable to write it, so he said to him:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3l0129_tls_001-7a.4" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-pro" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-12-03T01:16:19.026+09:00">"Gě Gōng of the state of Liáng is skilled at writing memorials.</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
</TEI>